        {
          "name": "Get report",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/{{report_id}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "reports", "{{report_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Poll a report's status.\n\nReturns **200** with:\n- `id` — report UUID\n- `source_type` — `url` or `pdf`\n- `source_url` — source URL (url reports)\n- `filename` — uploaded filename (pdf reports)\n- `status` — `queued` → `ingesting` → `extracting` → `modeling` → `done` | `failed`\n- `created_at` — ISO-8601 timestamp\n\nErrors:\n- **401** missing/bad bearer token\n- **404** unknown `report_id` (`Report not found.`)\n\nFor progress, `partial` results and `queue_position`, use **Get job** instead."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 Done",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/{{report_id}}"
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "content-type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"0a2f6ebc-bb64-4fbb-b527-7201adbc6f04\",\n  \"source_type\": \"url\",\n  \"source_url\": \"https://example.com/threat-report\",\n  \"filename\": null,\n  \"status\": \"done\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-08-04T12:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
            },
