        {
          "name": "Get report graph",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/{{report_id}}/graph",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "reports", "{{report_id}}", "graph"]
            },
            "description": "Interactive knowledge graph for a finished report.\n\nReturns **200** with:\n- `nodes[]`: `{ id, type, name, confidence }`\n  - `type` ∈ `threat-actor`, `malware`, `tool`, `web-shell`, `vulnerability`, `indicator`, `sector`, `country`, `campaign`, `email`, `file-path`\n  - `confidence` ∈ 0..1\n- `edges[]`: `{ id, source, target, type, confidence }`\n  - `type` ∈ `uses`, `exploits`, `targets`, `attributed-to`, `communicates-with`, `mitigated-by`, `executes`, `downloads`, `delivers`, `exfiltrates`\n  - `source`/`target` reference `node.id`\n\nErrors:\n- **404** unknown `report_id`\n- **409** graph not ready yet (`The report graph is not ready yet.`) — retry once `status` is `done`"
          },
          "response": [
