            "description": "Job detail for a report.\n\nReturns **200** with:\n- `id`, `report_id` — same UUID\n- `status` — lifecycle state (see collection description)\n- `progress` — free-form progress string (e.g. `relationships (3/7 chunks)`)\n- `partial` — `true` when results were salvaged from a partially-failed run\n- `error` — failure message when `status` is `failed`, else `null`\n- `queue_position` — position in the queue (running job = 1); only present while `queued`\n- `created_at`, `updated_at` — ISO-8601 timestamps\n\nErrors:\n- **401** missing/bad bearer token\n- **404** unknown id (`Job not found.`)"
          },
